  "description": "Fuaran.DB.Dialect.SqlServer — the SQL Server (T-SQL) dialect of the Fuaran.DB provider: bracket quoting, named parameter markers, OFFSET … FETCH paging with nulls last, the type map in both directions, every function, operator and aggregate either mapped or refused by name, and the decoding of a result cell, an int32 sum's overflow among them. Opens no connection and references no database driver.",
